    "id": "5763084f76bf555bf07f",
    "source": "The ENEMY doing it, if one did: exact enemyId from GAME STATE, with enemyAbility or spell. It is the enemy's action for the round (refused if it already acted, cannot act, or is charmed by a target); the save, DC, dice and condition come from the block or the spell whatever you send, a Recharge ability must have recharged, and a spell spends the enemy's slot. A concentration spell is tracked and ends when the enemy's concentration breaks or it dies.",
